Description: The DATRASextra package provides additional tools and helper
    functions to complement DTU Aquas DATRAS R package. It includes utilities for
    more flexible data processing, enhanced plotting, and simplified workflows when
    working with DATRAS survey data. The functions are designed to support common
    tasks in analysis and reporting that go beyond the core functionality of the
    main DATRAS package.
